13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,000
So, there are a couple of the frame types, including the ping-pongs.

14
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:36,000
But what's different with WebSocket is that the client and the server can send the messages anytime.

15
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:44,000
And if your tool can't pair these messages, you will miss the important vulnerabilities.

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:53,000
To handle this problem, WebSocket Turbo Intruder introduced the simple integer counter that counts all outgoing and incoming frames.

17
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
However, this simple approach has one big limitation. All the WebSocket services have broadcast messages.

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
